Haye Bemar Ko Zanjeer Pinathe Hai Aadu<br>
Kya Sitam Sayed-e-Sajjad Pe Dhathe Hai Aadu<br>
<br>
Baad-e-ashoor Ke Qainounko Jalakar Ran Main<br>
Ek Bimar Ko Ji Bharke Rulathe Hai Adu<br>
<br>
Chadarain Chinke Maa Behenoun Ke Sarse Hai Hai<br>
Bhare Bazar Main Abed Ko Phirare Hai Adu<br>
<br>
Be Kafan Baap Ke Laashe Ko Dikae Run Main<br>
Hai Sajjad Ko Dkode Bhi Laga They Hai Adu<br>
<br>
Shiddathey Tabse Hai Dushwaar Samawa Uska<br>
Har Qadam Durroun Pe Durre Bhi Lagathe Hai Adu<br>
<br>
Saath Maa Behnounke Darbar Main Jana Ke Liye<br>
Dushthey Bemar Ke Naizoun Se Chubathe Hai Adu<br>
<br>
Quld Se Fatima Zehra Ki Sada Ati Hai<br>
Zeher Sajjed Ko Dukhe Se Polathey Hai Adu<br>
<br>
Bada Shabbir Kabhi Chain Na Paya Tumhe<br>
Hai Sajjad Teri Qabr Main They Ahi Adu